# Deny everything, then re-include only what the image needs. An allowlist
# means a new dataset, notebook or cache directory stays out of the build
# context by default, rather than by someone remembering to add it here.
#
# The checkpoint dominates the context at 651MB and is included deliberately.
# The image bakes the model in so a container is self-contained and a rollback
# is a single image tag. Because models/ is gitignored and DVC tracked, a fresh
# clone has no weights: CI has to run "dvc pull" before "docker build".
*

!app
!models
!requirements.txt
